  "name": "Inkling 2 Mini (26B-A3B, NVFP4)",
  "description": "Thinking Machines Lab's first open model. A 26B mixture of experts whose middle layers run three times for every token, so it reasons like a larger model while reading only about 5B parameters per token. Text and image input, thinking, tool calling, and a context window of up to 1M tokens. This build keeps the original NVFP4 experts, about 18GB. Needs 32GB of memory or more.",
